 141:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.c ****     //Buffer size in half words.
 142:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.c ****     bufferSize = (bufferSize >> 1u);
 143:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.c **** 
