  28:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  * Configurable CDSP module
  29:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *
  30:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  * Interface layer of CDSP driver provides initialization and runtime reading of result.
  31:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *
  32:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  * \defgroup IfxLld_Adc_Cdsp_Usage How to use the CDSP Interface driver?
  33:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  * \ingroup IfxLld_Adc
  34:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *
  35:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *
  36:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  Configuration of CDSP core:
  37:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *
  38:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  Configuration of the CDSP core is contained in the IfxAdc_Cdsp_DspCoreConfig structure.
  39:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  This configuration structure contains:
  40:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  1. coreId          --> DSP core Id
  41:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  2. cdspSFR         --> pointer to the SFR base address of CDSP module
  42:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  3. timestampCfg    --> Time stamp configuration
  43:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  4. integratorCfg   --> Integrator configuration
  44:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  5. bndCfg          --> Limit Checking Configuration
  45:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  6. triggerCfg      --> Trigger setup with all triggers
  46:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  7. resSrvReqCfg    --> Result service request configuration(SR0)
  47:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  8. eventSrvReqCfg  --> Timestamp, wakeup event service request configuration.(SR1)
  48:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  9. alarmSrvReqCfg  --> Alarm service request configuration.(SR2)
  49:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  10.inputSel        --> CDSP input selection (TMADC, DSADC and GP register)
  50:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  11.resultCfg       --> Result handling configuration
  51:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  12.memCfg          --> Memory configuration
  52:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  13.inputMonitor    --> Input monitor selection
  53:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  14.runCdspCore     --> Set TRUE to run DSP core at the end of initialization.
  54:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *                         FALSE to run multiple core synchronously. \ref IfxAdc_Cdsp_enableMultipl
  55:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  15.filterchainSel  --> Filter chains selector
  56:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *
  57:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *
  58:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  Some of the elements are optional during configuration (triggerCfg, timestampCfg, bndCfg, integ
  59:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  User has to initialize objects of these types and map them to the config structure, if the user
  60:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *
  61:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  *  Steps to use the driver:
