  66:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  * Include following header file into your C code:
  67:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  * \code
  68:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h ****  * #include <Adc/Cdsp/IfxAdc_Cdsp.h>
