 525:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Dma/Dma/IfxDma_Dma.h ****  * \param[inout] dmaHandle Pointer to the DMA module handle.
 526:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Dma/Dma/IfxDma_Dma.h ****  * \param[in]    dma       Pointer to the DMA registers.
